WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.915
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.185 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:35.305 --> 01:39.025
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:43.065 --> 01:43.945
Here.

5
01:45.385 --> 01:46.705
Have some more.

6
01:49.145 --> 01:50.545
-Mother. -Have some more.

7
01:50.625 --> 01:52.345
Look how well-behaved this parrot is.

8
01:52.425 --> 01:54.385
His Majesty is still so devoted to you.

9
01:54.465 --> 01:55.745
Whenever he gets something fine,

10
01:55.825 --> 01:58.225
-he sends it to Changle Palace first. -Look at you.

11
01:58.305 --> 01:59.345
Mother!

12
02:00.745 --> 02:03.225
Mother, my brother is going to kill every member of the Han clan!

13
02:03.305 --> 02:05.745
Xiao, what are you talking about now?

14
02:05.825 --> 02:08.065
You already caused enough trouble last time!

15
02:08.144 --> 02:09.705
Have you no manners at all?

16
02:11.225 --> 02:12.065
Mother,

17
02:12.585 --> 02:14.345
the Han clan is in grave danger.

18
02:14.425 --> 02:16.465
The Marquis of Xiting and his son are in prison.

19
02:16.985 --> 02:18.065
The Empress is under house arrest too!

20
02:22.745 --> 02:25.065
I'm not dead yet,

21
02:25.145 --> 02:26.625
and he's already turned on the Han clan?

22
02:27.225 --> 02:29.025
Quick, summon him at once!

23
02:29.625 --> 02:30.705
Go!

24
02:33.105 --> 02:35.465
Mother, don't worry.

25
02:36.345 --> 02:40.505
ABUNDANT GRACE, AUSPICIOUS TIMES

26
02:40.585 --> 02:42.785
You must get this letter out of the palace.

27
02:45.665 --> 02:46.545
Keep it safe.

28
02:49.345 --> 02:51.345
-Rest assured, Your Majesty. -Go.

29
02:56.185 --> 02:57.585
JIAOFANG PALACE

30
03:04.945 --> 03:06.345
Stop.

31
03:22.585 --> 03:24.385
Lady Li has arrived!

32
03:28.025 --> 03:29.065
Greetings, Your Ladyship.

33
03:34.625 --> 03:36.585
His Majesty is angry for the moment,

34
03:36.665 --> 03:38.105
but he'll show mercy once his anger subsides.

35
03:39.065 --> 03:40.425
She is still the Empress.

36
03:41.345 --> 03:42.985
Show her some respect.

37
03:51.105 --> 03:54.465
All provisions for Jiaofang Palace must continue as before.

38
03:54.545 --> 03:57.265
Anyone who uses this to deny her provisions or mistreat her

39
03:57.785 --> 04:00.505
will face severe punishment if I find out.

40
04:01.305 --> 04:02.425
Yes.

41
04:04.265 --> 04:05.665
JIAOFANG PALACE

42
04:05.745 --> 04:06.585
Tell me,

43
04:07.185 --> 04:09.265
what was the Empress trying to do?

44
04:09.345 --> 04:10.505
With her situation so desperate,

45
04:11.025 --> 04:12.905
she must have sent a letter outside to seek help.

46
04:13.585 --> 04:15.185
Since you knew,

47
04:15.265 --> 04:17.265
why did you have me let her messenger go?

48
04:18.225 --> 04:21.064
Because Your Ladyship told me His Majesty is deeply suspicious

49
04:23.265 --> 04:24.585
and thinks of everything.

50
04:25.345 --> 04:29.145
Once the eunuch leaves the palace, whichever household's back door he enters,

51
04:29.225 --> 04:31.665
the Commandant's Office will find out exactly where he went.

52
04:36.025 --> 04:38.705
My daughter is so clever.

53
04:38.785 --> 04:40.705
How could I have been so foolish,

54
04:41.865 --> 04:44.585
thinking that get you out of these disputes would keep you safe?

55
04:49.185 --> 04:50.865
You had your own concerns, Your Ladyship.

56
04:52.505 --> 04:57.465
My daughter was always destined to be drawn into palace politics.

57
05:03.265 --> 05:04.385
This time,

58
05:05.265 --> 05:06.865
I'm not after power.

59
05:09.145 --> 05:10.345
I'm after justice.

60
05:11.305 --> 05:13.305
XUANSHI PALACE

61
05:13.385 --> 05:15.185
His Majesty has only placed the Empress under house arrest

62
05:15.265 --> 05:16.265
and has yet to make a decision.

63
05:16.985 --> 05:18.585
Could the Han clan still make a comeback?

64
05:19.585 --> 05:20.985
As long as the Empress Dowager is alive,

65
05:21.505 --> 05:23.185
His Majesty has to tread carefully.

66
05:23.265 --> 05:24.785
Then what do we do?

67
05:24.865 --> 05:26.145
Just let the Empress Dowager meddle in state affairs?

68
05:26.825 --> 05:28.145
Han Liao got endless blood debts.

69
05:28.225 --> 05:30.065
Do we just watch him walk free again?

70
05:30.665 --> 05:32.145
Is there any justice left?

71
05:33.105 --> 05:34.585
I'll plead with His Majesty again.

72
05:37.265 --> 05:39.065
Justice isn't won by begging on your knees.

73
05:40.065 --> 05:41.545
You have to risk lives and fight for it.

74
05:42.185 --> 05:43.225
You…

75
05:44.785 --> 05:45.865
Your Highness.

76
05:46.745 --> 05:47.865
Your Highness, wait.

77
05:50.505 --> 05:52.465
The Marquis of Xiting and his son plotted treason.

78
05:52.545 --> 05:53.785
His Majesty is furious.

79
05:54.425 --> 05:56.025
Please leave it for your own sake.

80
05:56.705 --> 05:59.985
Don't provoke His Majesty now and bring trouble on yourself.

81
06:03.145 --> 06:04.065
This is outrageous, Your Highness.

82
06:04.745 --> 06:05.985
Forgot where you are now?

83
06:06.625 --> 06:08.625
How dare you strike someone outside Xuanshi Palace?

84
06:11.065 --> 06:13.105
Prince Jing is my brother's eldest son.

85
06:13.625 --> 06:16.305
The Han clan is the Emperor's maternal family.

86
06:16.385 --> 06:17.785
Our family affairs

87
06:17.865 --> 06:20.905
are not for outsiders like you to interfere with!

88
06:21.625 --> 06:24.305
If you dare slander us before my brother again,

89
06:24.385 --> 06:27.225
I'll skin you alive!

90
06:28.265 --> 06:29.825
I wouldn't dare delay your business, Your Highness.

91
06:31.465 --> 06:32.505
Please, go ahead.

92
06:37.345 --> 06:38.465
What a wretched place!

93
06:41.145 --> 06:42.065
Unbelievable.

94
06:42.145 --> 06:44.065
His Majesty had him reflect on his conduct at home,

95
06:44.145 --> 06:45.425
yet he's grown more arrogant.

96
06:46.145 --> 06:47.705
That's exactly what we want.

97
06:49.785 --> 06:51.185
The more carried away he gets, the better.

98
06:55.465 --> 06:56.945
Your Majesty, take a good look.

99
06:57.025 --> 07:00.105
Every one of these memorials pleads for mercy on the Han clan.

100
07:00.705 --> 07:02.225
The Empress is your first wife,

101
07:02.305 --> 07:03.585
and Prince Jing is your eldest son.

102
07:03.665 --> 07:05.705
What has made you so heartless?

103
07:05.785 --> 07:08.465
Do you care nothing for the bonds of marriage

104
07:08.545 --> 07:09.545
or your own flesh and blood?

105
07:10.145 --> 07:12.545
Mother has a message for you. If you want to wipe them out,

106
07:13.145 --> 07:14.665
she is one of the Hans.

107
07:15.185 --> 07:19.305
You might as well abandon your filial duty and cut off your old mother's head too,

108
07:19.385 --> 07:21.545
so you can go down in history

109
07:21.625 --> 07:24.025
as a just ruler who spared not even his own kin!

110
07:34.825 --> 07:37.745
The Empress is consumed by jealousy and malice

111
07:38.625 --> 07:39.585
and is cruel at heart.

112
07:40.305 --> 07:42.905
She is unfit to honor the ancestors or serve as a mother to the realm.

113
07:43.505 --> 07:45.745
I hereby strip her of her rank

114
07:46.505 --> 07:47.465
and condemn her to Yongxiang, the palace prison.

115
07:48.505 --> 07:51.985
Prince Jing has failed to cultivate virtue and engaged in treason.

116
07:52.625 --> 07:54.185
For the sake of our bond as father and son,

117
07:54.825 --> 07:55.905
I spare his life,

118
07:56.825 --> 07:59.665
strip him of his rank, and banish him to Hanzhong Commandery.

119
08:00.185 --> 08:02.745
The Han clan still refuses to confess?

120
08:03.945 --> 08:05.385
Tell Boyao to use severe torture.

121
08:06.305 --> 08:08.065
If he fails to get answers,

122
08:08.585 --> 08:11.585
-I will hold him accountable! -Yes, Your Majesty.

123
08:11.665 --> 08:12.945
Your Majesty…

124
08:13.025 --> 08:14.225
Utter another word,

125
08:14.305 --> 08:16.705
and you'll be dragged out and beaten to death!

126
08:25.025 --> 08:28.185
Mother, my brother also said…

127
08:28.705 --> 08:29.545
What did he say?

128
08:30.185 --> 08:32.985
The Emperor is a son to Heaven and Earth,

129
08:33.065 --> 08:34.225
and father to all the people.

130
08:34.825 --> 08:36.385
To be a good emperor to his people,

131
08:36.465 --> 08:39.385
he can no longer be a good son to you.

132
08:39.904 --> 08:40.784
Fine.

133
08:42.264 --> 08:44.905
What an impartial emperor he is!

134
08:45.625 --> 08:48.025
Doesn't he want to kill every member of the Han clan?

135
08:48.985 --> 08:50.105
He needn't trouble himself.

136
08:50.785 --> 08:52.905
I will dash my brains out outside Xuanshi Palace.

137
08:53.505 --> 08:55.305
Let the whole world see

138
08:55.385 --> 08:59.985
what a heartless, cold-blooded son I have!

139
09:00.585 --> 09:02.505
Yes! We can't let him do as he pleases!

140
09:02.585 --> 09:05.105
Shut your mouth, you fool!

141
09:07.065 --> 09:09.745
Mother, please don't act rashly.

142
09:10.265 --> 09:13.025
Remember when you refused to eat in the past?

143
09:14.025 --> 09:16.225
His Majesty attended to you himself,

144
09:16.305 --> 09:17.585
showing the utmost devotion as your son.

145
09:18.265 --> 09:20.265
But now you've had neither food nor water.

146
09:20.345 --> 09:22.625
Has His Majesty come to see you even once?

147
09:23.385 --> 09:28.345
However deep your bond, it can't withstand this constant strain.

148
09:28.425 --> 09:31.625
Mother, you mustn't go.

149
09:31.705 --> 09:34.945
If you do, your bond as mother and son

150
09:35.025 --> 09:36.425
will be severed for good.

151
09:37.425 --> 09:42.505
I can't stand by and watch the entire Han clan be killed!

152
09:44.225 --> 09:50.025
As things stand, we can only sacrifice one to save the rest.

153
09:56.985 --> 09:59.625
By His Majesty's decree, Han is stripped of her rank.

154
10:00.225 --> 10:03.025
Her seal is to be reclaimed, and she must leave the Empress's palace

155
10:03.105 --> 10:04.465
and move to Yongxiang.

156
10:04.985 --> 10:06.105
Commoner Han, come with us.

157
10:06.705 --> 10:07.945
Impossible.

158
10:09.145 --> 10:10.105
This is impossible.

159
10:12.065 --> 10:13.305
It can't be.

160
10:14.025 --> 10:15.585
-You can't take my seal! -Quick!

161
10:15.665 --> 10:16.905
-Get it back! -It's mine!

162
10:16.985 --> 10:18.825
You can't take my seal!

163
10:18.905 --> 10:21.065
-Get it back! -You can't take my seal!

164
10:21.145 --> 10:22.265
If I'm unworthy of it,

165
10:22.345 --> 10:24.625
no one else shall have it!

166
10:24.705 --> 10:26.745
How dare you break the Empress's Seal!

167
10:26.825 --> 10:27.785
Do you have a death wish?

168
10:27.865 --> 10:31.625
I'm the Empress, the Empress Dowager's niece!

169
10:32.305 --> 10:34.105
His Majesty can't treat me like this.

170
10:34.865 --> 10:37.505
I want to see the Empress Dowager!

171
10:37.585 --> 10:38.865
Quick, after her!

172
10:51.905 --> 10:52.905
Your Majesty.

173
10:54.145 --> 10:55.345
It's you.

174
10:56.345 --> 10:58.105
How dare you come to gloat over me?

175
11:01.865 --> 11:03.265
You believed

176
11:04.305 --> 11:06.545
wealth and noble birth made you superior.

177
11:06.625 --> 11:09.345
People's lives meant nothing to you.

178
11:09.425 --> 11:10.585
You couldn't have cared less.

179
11:12.025 --> 11:15.185
Now, you're covered in dirt yourself and look utterly pitiful.

180
11:16.105 --> 11:17.585
When you killed Bitao,

181
11:19.145 --> 11:20.585
did you think you'd see this day?

182
11:23.065 --> 11:25.145
What Bitao? I know nothing about her.

183
11:26.665 --> 11:29.905
She was my maid, my friend,

184
11:30.825 --> 11:33.105
and the one who stood by me through years of hardship.

185
11:36.345 --> 11:39.385
-For a mere servant, you dare… -I dare!

186
11:41.465 --> 11:44.105
For Bitao, for myself,

187
11:44.745 --> 11:47.665
for all those whose lives and dignity you people trampled on at will,

188
11:47.745 --> 11:48.985
there's nothing I wouldn't dare!

189
11:50.185 --> 11:51.545
Such insolence!

190
11:52.105 --> 11:53.705
My aunt will save me.

191
11:54.585 --> 11:56.585
-The Empress Dowager… -Between you and the Han clan,

192
11:59.065 --> 12:00.545
the Empress Dowager can save only one.

193
12:05.665 --> 12:07.265
From this day on,

194
12:08.225 --> 12:12.025
your noble blood and immense power mean nothing.

195
12:14.025 --> 12:16.585
Only hard labor awaits you for the rest of your life.

196
12:17.705 --> 12:18.825
For the rest of your life,

197
12:20.025 --> 12:21.945
you'll live in Yongxiang,

198
12:22.025 --> 12:24.505
cowering like a homeless dog with its tail between its legs.

199
12:30.865 --> 12:31.865
Do you understand,

200
12:33.105 --> 12:34.625
Commoner Han?

201
12:36.145 --> 12:38.225
I'll kill you, you vile woman!

202
12:38.305 --> 12:41.345
I'll kill you!

203
12:41.985 --> 12:44.345
Why are you letting a commoner run wild in the palace?

204
12:45.025 --> 12:47.105
I'll kill you, you vile woman!

205
12:47.705 --> 12:49.785
I'll kill you!

206
13:00.385 --> 13:01.425
Lord Lu,

207
13:01.505 --> 13:03.705
Her Ladyship really isn't here.

208
13:03.785 --> 13:04.905
ZHUYU ESTATE

209
13:04.985 --> 13:08.025
Perhaps you could try looking up the hill.

210
13:11.185 --> 13:12.585
So she plans to go back on her word.

211
13:12.665 --> 13:14.345
Her word? What do you mean?

212
13:15.905 --> 13:18.945
Tell her she can't avoid me forever.

213
13:20.345 --> 13:24.065
However long she puts it off, she'll have to give me what she owes me.

214
13:51.705 --> 13:53.665
-Your Ladyship. -If Lord Lu comes,

215
13:53.745 --> 13:54.745
just say Her Ladyship isn't here.

216
13:55.345 --> 13:58.025
It's General Qi this time, not Lord Lu.

217
13:58.785 --> 14:01.185
He says he has good news for Her Ladyship.

218
14:01.265 --> 14:03.665
I didn't dare decide on my own.

219
14:04.705 --> 14:06.985
-Ask him to come over. -Yes.

220
14:16.545 --> 14:17.585
Wei Rao!

221
14:18.265 --> 14:19.185
Wei Rao.

222
14:23.345 --> 14:25.225
You've refused to see Lu Zhuo on three visits.

223
14:25.905 --> 14:26.785
Just hiding out doing farm work, huh?

224
14:28.185 --> 14:29.305
Something urgent?

225
14:29.985 --> 14:31.425
I came especially to tell you

226
14:32.105 --> 14:33.425
the Marquis of Xiting has killed himself in prison.

227
14:36.225 --> 14:37.305
The Marquis of Xiting is dead?

228
14:38.065 --> 14:40.105
Lu Zhuo kept up the pressure at every turn

229
14:40.185 --> 14:41.825
until the Han clan had nowhere left to turn.

230
14:42.745 --> 14:44.905
The Marquis took poison and left a letter,

231
14:45.425 --> 14:48.585
claiming those 120 suits of armor were meant to be buried with him.

232
14:48.665 --> 14:49.505
MARQUIS OF XITING'S RESIDENCE

233
14:49.585 --> 14:51.025
Since they were grave goods,

234
14:51.105 --> 14:52.385
and the Empress Dowager tearfully pleaded for mercy,

235
14:52.905 --> 14:54.105
His Majesty showed leniency

236
14:54.185 --> 14:55.825
and didn't convict the Han clan of treason,

237
14:55.905 --> 14:57.945
but of illegally hoarding weapons instead.

238
14:58.465 --> 15:00.465
Their title was revoked and their property confiscated.

239
15:00.545 --> 15:03.265
Han Liao was also demoted three ranks and left to serve in the army in disgrace.

240
15:04.305 --> 15:07.345
Too bad Han Liao escaped the worst.

241
15:10.745 --> 15:12.425
Of all the Han clan's members at court,

242
15:13.025 --> 15:14.785
few dare fight on the battlefield.

243
15:15.505 --> 15:17.625
Most of them were pushed out of the court's core.

244
15:18.265 --> 15:19.425
That's why the Empress Dowager fought so hard to protect him.

245
15:20.025 --> 15:22.585
Is that all you came to tell me, General?

246
15:22.665 --> 15:24.185
There's something even more important.

247
15:24.265 --> 15:27.225
At court today, His Majesty named Prince Duan as Crown Prince.

248
15:29.065 --> 15:29.985
I see.

249
15:38.785 --> 15:40.185
-Wei Rao… -I only wanted

250
15:40.265 --> 15:41.665
the murderers to be punished.

251
15:42.505 --> 15:44.265
My wish came true. I have no regrets.

252
15:44.865 --> 15:48.665
Who becomes Empress or Crown Prince has nothing to do with me.

253
15:49.265 --> 15:51.825
You don't care about state affairs, or you are avoiding Lu Zhuo?

254
15:55.785 --> 15:58.665
What exactly did you promise him that makes you so afraid of him?

255
16:05.785 --> 16:07.905
The chickens escaped! Catch them!

256
16:08.585 --> 16:09.785
Come and help!

257
16:10.865 --> 16:12.385
Aman, catch them!

258
16:24.025 --> 16:24.905
Don't run!

259
16:28.785 --> 16:31.145
-I'll block it here! -Why is this so hard?

260
16:31.225 --> 16:33.465
Come here.

261
16:39.945 --> 16:40.945
Don't run!

262
16:42.425 --> 16:43.345
Got it!

263
16:43.425 --> 16:44.385
Catch it!

264
16:56.025 --> 16:59.105
She died in Shuzhou, and both her children are missing.

265
17:00.345 --> 17:01.425
-You may go. -Yes.

266
17:03.385 --> 17:06.424
-My Lady, word has come from Shuzhou. -Over here!

267
17:06.505 --> 17:07.985
Madam Qiao fell ill and passed away.

268
17:08.545 --> 17:10.305
Her two children's whereabouts are unknown.

269
17:10.985 --> 17:12.025
What did you say?

270
17:12.545 --> 17:13.625
-This one. -Two wen.

271
17:13.704 --> 17:14.825
Fresh pastries!

272
17:14.905 --> 17:15.985
Here you are.

273
17:16.065 --> 17:17.065
Thank you.

274
17:17.145 --> 17:18.224
Let's go.

275
17:18.745 --> 17:20.865
Fresh pastries!

276
17:28.025 --> 17:28.865
Before Mother died,

277
17:29.545 --> 17:31.985
she kept telling us to come back and find Rao.

278
17:32.065 --> 17:32.905
But look at you.

279
17:32.985 --> 17:34.585
You could be living in comfort,

280
17:34.665 --> 17:35.785
yet you're out here selling flatbreads from dawn till dusk.

281
17:41.945 --> 17:45.385
Listen to me. We should ask her for a few gold coins.

282
17:46.145 --> 17:48.225
Mother saved her life. How could she refuse?

283
17:50.305 --> 17:51.505
Have you no shame?

284
17:52.025 --> 17:54.825
No girl has it worse than one without a mother's love.

285
17:55.465 --> 17:57.145
Her birth mother didn't want her.

286
17:57.225 --> 17:59.145
The mother who raised her fed her soup made from wild greens,

287
17:59.985 --> 18:01.625
and her whole family bled her dry.

288
18:02.545 --> 18:05.185
The money she gave us was more than enough for the funeral.

289
18:05.705 --> 18:08.425
I can earn my own living. I'm not going.

290
18:13.745 --> 18:14.865
You…

291
18:14.945 --> 18:16.185
Skip today, you'll go tomorrow.

292
18:16.265 --> 18:17.225
If she refuses me,

293
18:17.305 --> 18:18.345
-Give that back! -I'll shout it in the streets!

294
18:18.425 --> 18:20.945
Runsheng! Don't go gambling again!

295
18:21.665 --> 18:22.665
Excuse me.

296
18:22.745 --> 18:24.105
I'd like two sesame flatbreads.

297
18:26.505 --> 18:27.945
Two wen each.

298
18:28.025 --> 18:29.065
I'll take two.

299
18:40.185 --> 18:42.225
-You're back, Hongxian. -Yes, Mr. Wang.

300
18:53.665 --> 18:54.985
Let go of me!

301
18:56.905 --> 18:58.785
Let go! Let go of me!

302
18:58.865 --> 19:00.665
Let go of me!

303
19:02.225 --> 19:03.625
Help!

304
19:03.705 --> 19:07.665
Help! Help! Let go!

305
19:07.745 --> 19:08.585
HOUSE OF FORTUNE

306
19:08.665 --> 19:11.585
All bets are final once placed!

307
19:11.665 --> 19:12.985
Place your bets!

308
19:13.705 --> 19:16.585
High!

309
19:16.665 --> 19:17.705
Low!

310
19:19.825 --> 19:21.945
-Again! -Again!

311
19:22.025 --> 19:24.425
-High! -Place your bets!

312
19:37.785 --> 19:40.665
What are you staring at? Behave!

313
20:06.225 --> 20:07.385
Did they abduct you too?

314
20:10.105 --> 20:12.825
My father's a constable. He'll come and rescue me.

315
20:13.665 --> 20:14.745
Once I'm out,

316
20:14.825 --> 20:17.545
I'll have him arrest these traffickers and have them beheaded.

317
20:29.545 --> 20:30.585
There's a banquet here tomorrow.

318
20:31.265 --> 20:32.665
Don't spend all your time drinking and gambling.

319
20:33.305 --> 20:34.585
Keep a close watch on them.

320
20:35.265 --> 20:36.305
Understood.

321
20:41.905 --> 20:43.305
Food's ready. Gather around.

322
20:43.905 --> 20:45.225
Stop dawdling! Hurry!

323
20:45.905 --> 20:48.185
Hurry! What are you waiting for? Stop dawdling!

324
20:48.945 --> 20:49.785
Hurry up!

325
20:49.865 --> 20:51.585
Do you two want to eat or not?

326
20:51.665 --> 20:52.545
Hurry.

327
20:52.625 --> 20:54.105
Move. You stink. Take it.

328
21:04.385 --> 21:05.425
Come on.

329
21:06.105 --> 21:07.225
What are you doing? Stop them!

330
21:07.305 --> 21:08.625
Stay inside!

331
21:08.705 --> 21:09.625
-Go after them! -Get back!

332
21:13.025 --> 21:15.265
Stop! Stop them!

333
21:15.345 --> 21:17.665
-After them! Don't let them escape! -Stop!

334
21:19.185 --> 21:20.625
-Stop! -Stop!

335
21:22.345 --> 21:24.185
The potted plum trees from the Empress Dowager

336
21:24.265 --> 21:25.705
will go here.

337
21:26.585 --> 21:27.825
Yes.

338
21:28.625 --> 21:29.745
Your Highness,

339
21:29.825 --> 21:32.225
this is a congratulatory gift from the Censor-in-Chief.

340
21:32.305 --> 21:33.785
This natural black stone

341
21:33.865 --> 21:36.305
has white veins like rolling, snow-white waves.

342
21:38.065 --> 21:39.425
It's a rare find indeed.

343
21:40.185 --> 21:41.665
The bamboo grove outside His Highness's study

344
21:41.745 --> 21:43.225
could use an ornamental rock.

345
21:43.305 --> 21:44.625
Have it taken there.

346
21:44.705 --> 21:45.705
Yes.

347
21:46.865 --> 21:50.265
Shu, now that you're Crown Princess,

348
21:50.345 --> 21:51.705
you no longer have to rely on anyone's favor.

349
21:51.785 --> 21:53.945
You can avenge Mother now, right?

350
21:55.305 --> 21:58.265
Chan, how many times have I told you?

351
21:58.345 --> 22:00.785
Sisters must support one another.

352
22:00.865 --> 22:03.225
We must never let infighting give others an opening.

353
22:03.305 --> 22:06.865
Shu, have you forgotten how much Mother loved you?

354
22:07.545 --> 22:08.945
You've forgotten all she did for you.

355
22:09.545 --> 22:11.025
I'm not speaking to you anymore.

356
22:11.945 --> 22:13.065
The greater good comes first.

357
22:13.145 --> 22:16.065
Help! Bandits!

358
22:16.145 --> 22:17.025
-Hold her down! -Don't move!

359
22:17.105 --> 22:18.145
-What's going on? -Help!

360
22:18.225 --> 22:19.105
Behave!

361
22:21.425 --> 22:22.225
Enough, Chan.

362
22:22.985 --> 22:25.665
You should go home. Don't make Grandmother worry.

363
22:26.505 --> 22:28.345
-Escort Lady Chan home. -Yes.

364
22:29.785 --> 22:31.065
This way, Lady Chan.

365
22:40.545 --> 22:42.545
BEHOLD THE WAVES

366
22:42.625 --> 22:45.305
We have a guest here. Why all this noise?

367
22:47.345 --> 22:49.105
-Behave! -Let go!

368
22:52.265 --> 22:53.465
Your Highness,

369
22:53.545 --> 22:56.305
we've been very busy these past two days.

370
22:56.385 --> 22:58.665
Some maids got into trouble and are being punished.

371
22:58.745 --> 22:59.745
We wouldn't want to trouble you with this.

372
23:00.505 --> 23:01.505
Take them away.

373
23:02.425 --> 23:03.745
Your Ladyship! Your Ladyship!

374
23:04.345 --> 23:05.345
Please save us!

375
23:05.425 --> 23:08.345
-They abducted me! -Take her away! Quickly!

376
23:09.305 --> 23:11.025
-Your Ladyship! Your Ladyship! -My sister is Noble Lady Wu'an!

377
23:12.145 --> 23:13.945
Abducting a noble lady's sister is punishable by death!

378
23:14.025 --> 23:14.865
Let me go at once,

379
23:14.945 --> 23:16.465
or neither Heaven nor the law will spare you!

380
23:17.145 --> 23:18.465
Stop! Let go of her.

381
23:23.305 --> 23:24.265
Your Ladyship,

382
23:24.785 --> 23:26.425
I really am Noble Lady Wu'an's sister.

383
23:27.025 --> 23:28.785
Send someone to Zhuyu Estate.

384
23:28.865 --> 23:30.105
If my sister knows you've freed me,

385
23:30.185 --> 23:34.225
she'll reward you handsomely and repay your kindness.

386
23:41.145 --> 23:42.745
What exactly is going on?

387
23:42.825 --> 23:45.385
There are many more girls locked back there.

388
23:45.465 --> 23:47.545
They were all abducted and brought here.

389
23:47.625 --> 23:50.105
If you don't believe me, Your Ladyship, go and see for yourself.

390
23:54.705 --> 23:55.785
Lead the way.

391
24:07.825 --> 24:09.825
Come on. We're saved.

392
24:26.625 --> 24:28.625
They're all so young.

393
24:28.705 --> 24:29.985
These poor girls.

394
24:31.945 --> 24:34.105
Your Ladyship, we were all abducted!

395
24:34.185 --> 24:36.985
Your Ladyship! Let us go home, Your Ladyship!

396
24:37.065 --> 24:37.945
Your Ladyship, let us go home!

397
24:38.025 --> 24:39.745
You're kind and merciful.

398
24:39.825 --> 24:41.265
Please save us!

399
24:41.345 --> 24:42.865
Save us!

400
24:42.945 --> 24:45.545
Please let us go home, Your Ladyship!

401
24:45.625 --> 24:46.625
Your Ladyship!

402
24:54.705 --> 24:56.505
You can't even handle something this simple.

403
24:57.425 --> 24:58.825
What use are you?

404
25:13.545 --> 25:17.145
Deal with those who tried to escape in the usual way.

405
25:17.225 --> 25:18.265
Yes.

406
25:43.905 --> 25:46.865
I'll haunt you even after I die!

407
25:48.785 --> 25:50.705
No!

408
25:52.865 --> 25:56.225
Even with her dying breath, she had to curse me.

409
25:57.785 --> 25:59.585
Drive a peachwood sword through her heart,

410
26:00.385 --> 26:02.025
cut out the tongue she planned to use against us,

411
26:02.625 --> 26:05.905
burn her to ashes, and bury them beneath the garden paving.

412
26:05.985 --> 26:07.385
Let countless feet trample her.

413
26:08.345 --> 26:10.385
Let's see how her spirit haunts me then.

414
26:17.305 --> 26:21.825
You claim to be Noble Lady Wu'an's sister.

415
26:22.905 --> 26:24.985
When did the Wei family gain a girl like you?

416
26:25.745 --> 26:26.865
How did I not know?

417
26:26.945 --> 26:30.625
Lying is a bad habit, but don't worry.

418
26:31.185 --> 26:32.465
I can rid you of it.

419
26:33.465 --> 26:34.305
Is everything ready?

420
26:35.545 --> 26:36.785
She's different from the others.

421
26:36.865 --> 26:38.625
His Highness had her brought here.

422
26:43.625 --> 26:44.625
Bring it in.

423
26:50.025 --> 26:51.425
No!

424
26:52.025 --> 26:53.625
Wei Rao really is my sister!

425
26:54.625 --> 26:55.785
I'm not lying!

426
26:55.865 --> 26:58.385
Please let me go! I'm not lying!

427
26:58.465 --> 27:00.145
If you're lying, I won't let you go.

428
27:00.745 --> 27:02.185
If it's true, all the more reason to keep you here.

429
27:03.385 --> 27:05.305
The moment you set foot in this residence,

430
27:05.865 --> 27:07.985
you lost any chance of ever leaving.

431
27:09.145 --> 27:11.545
Lowly girl, how dare you claim kinship with a noble lady?

432
27:15.945 --> 27:17.785
Use molten lead as the key ingredient

433
27:20.585 --> 27:22.865
to cure her of these outrageous lies.

434
27:23.985 --> 27:27.265
Please spare me!

435
27:27.945 --> 27:29.305
-Give her the medicine. -Please!

436
27:30.105 --> 27:32.585
No!

437
27:34.385 --> 27:37.745
No!

438
27:51.505 --> 27:53.625
Many honored guests will be here tomorrow.

439
27:54.545 --> 27:58.505
Make sure the little birds out back keep quiet.

440
27:59.385 --> 28:00.345
Yes.

441
28:04.065 --> 28:05.145
Rao!

442
28:05.665 --> 28:07.145
Rao!

443
28:07.225 --> 28:11.425
Rao, save me! Save me!

444
28:11.505 --> 28:12.785
Rao!

445
28:18.025 --> 28:18.985
What's wrong, My Lady?

446
28:19.585 --> 28:22.505
I heard Hongxian's voice. She was calling for me.

447
28:23.465 --> 28:26.865
All the estate's guards are out searching. If she really has returned to the capital,

448
28:27.585 --> 28:28.785
they'll find her.

449
28:29.545 --> 28:30.905
Please don't worry, My Lady.

450
28:32.825 --> 28:36.985
You're attending a banquet at the Crown Prince's residence today.

451
28:37.665 --> 28:39.625
Let me help you wash and dress.

452
28:39.705 --> 28:41.665
No need. I'll do it myself.

453
28:42.705 --> 28:45.825
I've already told them to report to you immediately

454
28:45.905 --> 28:47.305
as soon as they have any leads.

455
28:51.825 --> 28:54.345
Have them check every gambling house in the capital too.

456
28:56.545 --> 28:57.665
Yes.

457
29:07.305 --> 29:10.105
-Come next time. -Take care.

458
29:10.185 --> 29:11.905
-It's fresh. -Sir, come and have a look!

459
29:11.985 --> 29:13.425
Come and see!

460
29:13.505 --> 29:15.345
SILKS AND FINE FABRICS

461
29:20.785 --> 29:21.705
Lord Lu.

462
29:22.305 --> 29:24.505
My Lady, it's Lord Lu.

463
29:30.785 --> 29:32.785
I'm in a hurry to attend the Crown Prince's banquet.

464
29:33.305 --> 29:34.225
Please let us pass, Lord Lu.

465
29:35.185 --> 29:36.985
Lord Lu has a few words for Your Ladyship.

466
29:37.065 --> 29:38.905
He'll leave once heard. Please step out of the carriage.

467
29:44.225 --> 29:45.865
What's so urgent, Lord Lu,

468
29:47.105 --> 29:48.105
that you had to stop me here?

469
29:53.345 --> 29:54.545
What are you doing?

470
29:55.985 --> 29:57.025
I have guards with me.

471
29:57.745 --> 29:59.025
Your Ladyship promised

472
29:59.745 --> 30:00.785
that once we brought down our enemies,

473
30:01.385 --> 30:02.705
you'd take me back.

474
30:03.545 --> 30:05.785
Were you only stringing me along?

475
30:07.825 --> 30:09.985
You barged into my room in the middle of the night,

476
30:10.505 --> 30:13.265
threatened me, tempted me, and did all the talking.

477
30:13.345 --> 30:14.585
I never agreed to anything.

478
30:18.385 --> 30:21.705
Your Ladyship really is two-faced and never keeps a promise.

479
30:21.785 --> 30:23.425
You haven't even crossed the river,

480
30:23.505 --> 30:25.185
yet you're rushing to tear the bridge down.

481
30:28.705 --> 30:29.985
But I have my pride too.

482
30:30.785 --> 30:32.225
I won't keep pestering you.

483
30:42.145 --> 30:43.345
Rest assured.

484
30:44.225 --> 30:45.705
I won't mention this again,

485
30:47.705 --> 30:49.425
and you needn't avoid me like the plague.

486
30:50.705 --> 30:51.545
Really?

487
30:55.305 --> 30:56.305
Unless you beg me yourself,

488
30:57.425 --> 30:58.825
I won't bring it up again.

489
30:58.905 --> 31:00.825
Beg you? Dream on.

490
31:01.905 --> 31:04.105
How generous of you, Lord Lu. I'll be on my way.

491
31:05.625 --> 31:06.745
Wait.

492
31:10.945 --> 31:11.985
Zhao Bai.

493
31:19.305 --> 31:22.065
He's strong and skilled at riding and archery.

494
31:22.145 --> 31:24.585
He's also well-versed in music and knows how to be good company.

495
31:25.145 --> 31:26.985
He can cheer you up when you're troubled.

496
31:27.745 --> 31:30.345
Are you offering me Deputy General Zhao, Lord Lu?

497
31:30.945 --> 31:34.305
At today's banquet, you'll have no shortage of such offers.

498
31:35.105 --> 31:36.185
Not that I'd be invited.

499
31:36.865 --> 31:37.985
Do try to keep your composure

500
31:38.065 --> 31:41.145
and avoid being taken advantage by the schemers.

501
31:53.505 --> 31:56.305
Your Ladyship, what did Lord Lu say to you?

502
31:57.425 --> 32:00.225
Odd remarks. I couldn't make sense of them.

503
32:00.305 --> 32:01.265
Pay him no mind.

504
32:03.225 --> 32:06.425
‎-Sure. ‎-Good.

505
32:06.985 --> 32:08.585
You can certainly hold your liquor!

506
32:30.105 --> 32:31.545
Congratulations, Your Highness.

507
32:39.265 --> 32:40.465
All right.

508
32:41.385 --> 32:42.665
Have a drink too.

509
32:48.025 --> 32:50.105
Your Ladyship, please.

510
32:54.225 --> 32:55.185
Keep your distance.

511
32:55.905 --> 32:58.105
He's strong and skilled at riding and archery.

512
32:58.185 --> 32:59.905
He's also well-versed in music and knows how to be good company.

513
33:00.945 --> 33:03.825
At today's banquet, you'll have no shortage of such offers.

514
33:03.905 --> 33:05.305
So that's what he meant.

515
33:20.185 --> 33:21.545
The one in there is lucky.

516
33:21.625 --> 33:23.065
His Highness has his eye on her.

517
33:23.145 --> 33:25.865
Otherwise, she'd be buried tonight too.

518
33:25.945 --> 33:27.225
He'll lose interest in a couple of days.

519
33:28.705 --> 33:30.305
The Crown Princess is quite something.

520
33:30.385 --> 33:32.505
She likes letting them escape, then catching them again.

521
33:32.585 --> 33:34.025
We should learn a few new tricks.

522
33:34.105 --> 33:36.225
Make His Highness laugh, and he'll reward us handsomely.

523
33:36.305 --> 33:37.465
All right, enough.

524
33:45.905 --> 33:47.945
You little charmer.

525
33:49.865 --> 33:52.105
This is your first banquet of this kind, Your Ladyship.

526
33:52.185 --> 33:53.025
You'll get used to it.

527
33:53.625 --> 33:54.745
I'm not like them.

528
33:56.185 --> 33:57.385
Have a drink!

529
33:59.105 --> 34:01.185
Cheng was meant for the Eldest Princess's Residence.

530
34:01.265 --> 34:03.625
But the Crown Princess said, His Highness owes his success

531
34:03.705 --> 34:04.665
to Your Ladyship.

532
34:04.745 --> 34:06.945
So His Highness sent Cheng to attend to you.

533
34:08.865 --> 34:10.145
Fill it up!

534
34:21.264 --> 34:22.425
Take it away.

535
34:34.425 --> 34:36.344
How fortunate I am to meet an old friend tonight.

536
34:37.665 --> 34:39.425
Yet Your Ladyship doesn't seem to recognize me.

537
34:40.344 --> 34:43.545
Now that you've risen in the world, have you forgotten your old friends?

538
34:44.185 --> 34:45.545
Do you remember the Liu family's mill?

539
34:54.705 --> 34:55.865
A-Chou.

540
35:11.585 --> 35:14.505
There are many things about this world that Your Ladyship finds distasteful.

541
35:15.105 --> 35:17.225
But nobles have their eggs painted before eating them

542
35:17.305 --> 35:19.505
and patterns carved into their firewood.

543
35:20.545 --> 35:23.145
As the saying goes, "the Emperor treasures pearls and jade,

544
35:23.225 --> 35:24.745
and feudal lords, gold and stone.

545
35:25.345 --> 35:28.785
Ministers keep dogs and horses, and commoners store cloth and silk."

546
35:29.545 --> 35:31.185
Know one's station,

547
35:31.265 --> 35:32.865
do one's part.

548
35:33.665 --> 35:36.705
Wealth and power are now within Your Ladyship's reach.

549
35:36.785 --> 35:38.585
Others like you indulge in pleasure.

550
35:38.665 --> 35:40.625
You should feel free to enjoy it too.

551
35:42.905 --> 35:45.705
The Eldest Princess has countless favorites.

552
35:45.785 --> 35:47.185
I won't trade on my looks.

553
35:47.705 --> 35:48.745
I willingly serve Your Ladyship.

554
35:49.385 --> 35:52.065
I may not be skilled in performances, but I'm quick with numbers.

555
35:52.585 --> 35:54.625
I can stay by your side as a trusted aide.

556
35:55.985 --> 35:58.705
Will you take me with you, Your Ladyship?

557
36:12.545 --> 36:14.425
I knew you still remembered me.

558
36:19.305 --> 36:21.225
Who said Wu'an couldn't be won over?

559
36:22.665 --> 36:24.545
You really are a thoughtful cousin.

560
36:25.585 --> 36:27.345
Your gift was just what she wanted.

561
36:39.665 --> 36:40.585
See?

562
36:41.105 --> 36:43.465
Everyone's the same, after all.

563
36:43.985 --> 36:49.265
CROWN PRINCE'S RESIDENCE

564
36:51.385 --> 36:53.625
My Lord, you already warned Her Ladyship.

565
36:53.705 --> 36:55.105
She'll surely be on her guard.

566
36:56.105 --> 36:57.065
Not necessarily.

567
36:58.545 --> 36:59.985
Real mind games, after all,

568
37:00.945 --> 37:02.025
few can stand against it.

569
37:03.025 --> 37:05.665
Then, My Lord, why don't you attend the banquet yourself?

570
37:07.265 --> 37:09.905
She doesn't want to see me. Why should I go?

571
37:15.105 --> 37:16.345
Let's go home.

572
37:17.585 --> 37:18.705
Let's go.

573
37:25.185 --> 37:27.465
She won't let those handsome men fool her, will she?

574
37:39.145 --> 37:40.265
After her!

575
37:46.945 --> 37:49.185
Rao!

576
37:51.945 --> 37:53.065
Quick, after her!

577
38:03.905 --> 38:05.065
Split up!

578
38:06.705 --> 38:09.225
I'm done. No more for me.

579
38:11.465 --> 38:12.785
Dance with me.

580
38:26.025 --> 38:27.985
For that dish of phoenix tongues just now,

581
38:28.705 --> 38:30.825
it took the finest tongues from over a thousand buntings

582
38:30.905 --> 38:32.505
just to fill one small plate.

583
38:33.865 --> 38:35.465
As for this meat stew,

584
38:35.545 --> 38:38.385
the steamed deer tails may smell strong,

585
38:39.305 --> 38:41.545
but that's what makes them so nourishing.

586
38:42.625 --> 38:44.145
Try some, everyone.

587
38:44.225 --> 38:47.065
Thank you, Your Highness!

588
38:56.745 --> 38:58.665
That's delicious.

589
39:06.705 --> 39:08.705
If you leave, His Highness will punish me.

590
39:09.865 --> 39:12.665
-Let go. -Despite my warm hospitality,

591
39:13.785 --> 39:15.585
your cousin doesn't seem to be enjoying herself.

592
39:24.105 --> 39:25.305
Your Ladyship, please take me with you.

593
39:33.025 --> 39:33.905
Let go.

594
39:35.825 --> 39:36.865
Your Ladyship…

595
39:37.825 --> 39:38.825
Rao.

596
39:42.625 --> 39:45.265
His Highness' appointment as Crown Prince, you are chiefly to thank.

597
39:45.345 --> 39:48.705
Let me offer you a toast on his behalf. Please drink the whole cup.

598
39:49.465 --> 39:50.345
You give me too much credit.

599
40:00.705 --> 40:02.185
Your Ladyship, we've found someone.

600
40:03.345 --> 40:05.305
There's urgent business at the estate. I must return at once.

601
40:05.905 --> 40:07.865
Your hospitality has been most generous. I'll thank you properly another day.

602
40:08.905 --> 40:10.145
Leaving so soon?

603
40:12.745 --> 40:16.305
Very well. I know what you're like. I won't keep you.

604
40:17.345 --> 40:19.825
Cheng, go home with Her Ladyship.

605
40:20.425 --> 40:22.585
Be sure to serve her well.

606
40:25.465 --> 40:26.785
Did you fail to attend to her properly?

607
40:27.665 --> 40:30.545
Her Ladyship seems reluctant to take you with her.

608
40:31.545 --> 40:33.705
Please take me in. I'll work myself to the bone

609
40:33.785 --> 40:35.785
to repay your kindness.

610
40:35.865 --> 40:36.945
I have other urgent business.

611
40:37.025 --> 40:38.705
Aman, take him back to the estate.

612
40:55.825 --> 40:59.065
-Sure. -Fill my cup again!

613
41:02.265 --> 41:03.985
What are you doing? I was about to win my money back!

614
41:04.065 --> 41:06.425
Let go of me! Who are you?

615
41:08.265 --> 41:09.465
Who on earth are you?

616
41:10.105 --> 41:12.545
My sister is Noble Lady Wu'an!

617
41:13.145 --> 41:14.625
I'll have her deal with you!

618
41:20.585 --> 41:22.905
-Rao. What are you doing here? -Where's Hongxian?

619
41:23.585 --> 41:25.385
I told her to come find you, but she refused.

620
41:25.985 --> 41:28.385
-We rented an old house nearby. -Take me there.

621
41:30.185 --> 41:32.945
Rao, do you have any gold coins?

622
41:33.785 --> 41:35.545
Lend… lend me some so I can win my money back.

623
41:38.785 --> 41:39.985
Lead the way!

624
41:46.065 --> 41:47.185
Give it to me!

625
41:47.265 --> 41:48.785
-Hand it over! -I saw it first!

626
41:48.865 --> 41:50.105
-Let go! -I saw it first!

627
41:50.185 --> 41:51.665
-I took it, so it's mine! -Give it to me!

628
41:51.745 --> 41:53.185
-Let go! -You let go!

629
41:53.265 --> 41:54.105
Hand it over!

630
41:54.185 --> 41:55.625
-You've already taken so much! -Give it to me!

631
41:56.665 --> 41:57.505
It's mine!

632
41:57.585 --> 41:59.105
-These belong to my family! -You've already taken so much!

633
42:00.305 --> 42:01.625
You're stealing from us!

634
42:02.225 --> 42:03.185
She's never coming back.

635
42:03.785 --> 42:05.745
A hopeless gambler like you can't run a business.

636
42:05.825 --> 42:07.265
All these would go to waste.

637
42:07.345 --> 42:08.545
-What's wrong with us taking a few? -Exactly!

638
42:08.625 --> 42:09.465
You…!

639
42:10.585 --> 42:11.825
Oh, heavens!

640
42:11.905 --> 42:13.025
What do you mean, she's never coming back?

641
42:13.105 --> 42:14.425
Where did Hongxian go?

642
42:14.505 --> 42:17.945
She said it. She said Miss Hongxian had been abducted,

643
42:18.025 --> 42:19.265
and there would be no one to claim her belongings.

644
42:19.345 --> 42:20.505
That's why I came to take them.

645
42:20.585 --> 42:22.785
Spare me, Your Ladyship! Spare me!

646
42:22.865 --> 42:24.545
-What nonsense are you spouting? -Spare me, Your Ladyship!

647
42:24.625 --> 42:26.265
You had to be so greedy!

648
42:26.345 --> 42:28.185
You already took so much, yet you still fought me for a sieve!

649
42:28.265 --> 42:29.105
Who abducted Hongxian?

650
42:29.865 --> 42:32.065
As soon as Miss Hongxian left the alley,

651
42:32.145 --> 42:34.025
several burly men rushed at her.

652
42:34.105 --> 42:35.705
They gagged her, covered her head, and took her away.

653
42:36.385 --> 42:38.905
-I don't know who they were. -Which way did they go?

654
42:38.985 --> 42:40.105
Which way…

655
42:40.185 --> 42:41.505
Tell her!

656
42:41.585 --> 42:43.665
East! They went east!

657
42:43.745 --> 42:44.825
They went east.

658
42:50.385 --> 42:52.185
Easy!

659
42:53.225 --> 42:55.345
AS THE SUN RISES

660
42:56.545 --> 42:58.065
He's the biggest broker in this area.

661
42:58.145 --> 43:00.665
Every sale of a slave goes through him.

662
43:02.945 --> 43:03.945
Have you seen her?

663
43:05.145 --> 43:07.545
No. Never.

664
43:09.745 --> 43:10.585
Look carefully!

665
43:10.665 --> 43:12.425
I'm innocent!

666
43:12.505 --> 43:15.705
Spare me, Your Ladyship! I really haven't seen her.

667
43:15.785 --> 43:17.745
-But… -But what?

668
43:17.825 --> 43:19.025
To tell you both the truth,

669
43:19.625 --> 43:23.385
over the past two years, many girls have gone missing in the city.

670
43:23.465 --> 43:25.945
The youngest are barely 13, the oldest only 15 or 16.

671
43:26.025 --> 43:28.465
You turn your back for a moment, and someone just vanishes.

672
43:29.425 --> 43:30.945
Haven't the authorities investigated?

673
43:31.025 --> 43:32.665
They're just girls from poor families.

674
43:32.745 --> 43:35.785
Who knows whether they starved to death, died from hardship,

675
43:35.865 --> 43:38.825
were taken by traffickers, or abducted by bandits?

676
43:38.905 --> 43:40.905
There's no way to trace what happened.

677
43:42.105 --> 43:47.025
Some refused to give up and even petitioned the Court of Justice.

678
43:47.105 --> 43:49.465
But nothing ever came of it.

679
43:50.745 --> 43:52.425
Those powerful officials only concern themselves

680
43:52.505 --> 43:54.505
with state affairs.

681
43:54.585 --> 43:56.905
Who would care about what happens to poor families?

682
43:58.505 --> 44:00.705
Listen. Alive or dead, I want her found!

683
44:01.305 --> 44:02.985
Don't think you can talk your way out of this!

684
44:03.065 --> 44:04.825
If I've told you a single lie,

685
44:04.905 --> 44:07.145
may a bolt of lightning strike me dead on the spot!

686
44:07.985 --> 44:10.305
-Qi Zhongkai. -Please don't hit me!

687
44:14.945 --> 44:17.345
Your Ladyship, Lord Lu insisted on barging in.

688
44:17.425 --> 44:18.945
You couldn't have stopped him. It's fine.

689
44:19.865 --> 44:21.425
Even if you kill him tonight,

690
44:21.945 --> 44:23.385
there are things he won't dare to tell you.

691
44:25.465 --> 44:26.345
Do you know who's behind this?

692
44:28.865 --> 44:30.185
I don't.

693
44:31.025 --> 44:33.185
But I know someone dares to abduct girls

694
44:33.265 --> 44:34.905
right in the capital, acting without a care,

695
44:35.425 --> 44:36.865
committing crimes over the years,

696
44:38.345 --> 44:41.345
while the people dare not ask questions, and the authorities dare not investigate.

697
44:43.025 --> 44:45.905
What kind of person has that much power?

698
44:47.385 --> 44:48.825
Someone of royal or noble blood.

699
44:50.105 --> 44:50.945
Could it be Prince Rong?

700
44:51.625 --> 44:53.785
It can't be. Prince Rong is lustful,

701
44:54.505 --> 44:56.865
but the women he favors are beautiful, voluptuous widows.

702
44:57.905 --> 44:59.145
Everyone in the capital knows it.

703
45:00.065 --> 45:03.065
He just told us the missing girls were all very young.

704
45:03.665 --> 45:07.145
Anyone who abducts girls must have bought and sold them too.

705
45:08.025 --> 45:10.145
You run the city's largest brokerage.

706
45:10.225 --> 45:13.145
You know all the secret tastes of the capital's rich and powerful.

707
45:13.745 --> 45:16.425
Tell us the truth, and I'll let you live.

708
45:17.105 --> 45:19.945
I swear to Heaven, I know nothing about it!

709
45:22.185 --> 45:24.065
My estate has taken in many displaced people.

710
45:24.145 --> 45:26.745
Many brokers like you have tried to abduct

711
45:27.345 --> 45:29.505
and sell children and young girls amid the chaos.

712
45:30.345 --> 45:32.665
Do you know what I do to them once I find them?

713
45:34.305 --> 45:39.145
Her Ladyship's estate is orderly because she has one ironclad rule.

714
45:39.225 --> 45:41.625
Anyone found abducting and selling women or children

715
45:43.625 --> 45:45.025
is paraded through the streets for three days,

716
45:46.585 --> 45:47.545
then executed by slow slicing.

717
45:48.825 --> 45:50.185
Do you know what slow slicing means?

718
45:50.905 --> 45:52.545
Three thousand cuts,

719
45:53.065 --> 45:54.145
carving you up while you're alive.

720
45:55.585 --> 45:57.105
No, please don't!

721
45:57.185 --> 46:00.585
I'll talk! I've only heard a few rumors.

722
46:00.665 --> 46:03.505
If word gets out, my entire family will be killed!

723
46:05.345 --> 46:06.865
I'll talk!

724
46:06.945 --> 46:10.105
There are quite a few powerful men in the capital

725
46:10.185 --> 46:12.225
with this taste,

726
46:12.305 --> 46:14.065
but the only one even the Commandant of Justice won't dare investigate

727
46:14.865 --> 46:16.945
-is… -Who?

728
46:17.025 --> 46:20.305
The Crown Prince.

729
48:41.545 --> 48:44.585
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
